<h2 id='fallback-authentication-flows'>Fallback Authentication Flows</h2><pre class="highlight diff tab-diff"><code>Updated Fallback Authentication Flows section
<span class="gd">- 'Redirect to Web with OTP' flow
</span><span class="gi">+ 'Redirect to Web' flow
</span></code></pre>
<p>On and before <strong>29 April 2028</strong>: Where Redirect to App is unable to be used for the purposes of CDR authentication, and Decoupled Authentication is not supported, data holders <strong>MUST</strong> continue to support the &#39;Redirect to Web with OTP&#39; flow in accordance with the relevant <a href="#consumer-experience_authentication-standards">consumer experience authentication</a> and <a href="#security-profile">security profile</a> standards.</p>

<p>On and from <strong>30 April 2028</strong>: Where Redirect to App is unable to be used for the purposes of CDR authentication, and Decoupled Authentication is not supported, data holder <strong>MUST</strong> support <a href="#redirect-to-web">Redirect to Web</a> flow in accordance with the relevant <a href="#consumer-experience_authentication-standards">consumer experience authentication</a> and <a href="#security-profile">security profile</a> standards.</p>
